- The validator rejected `demo.html` because an image path built in the JS looked like a missing file. I changed it to build the images through the DOM, and validation passed after that.
- The screenshot check showed the hero headshots stretched past the hero into the next section. One CSS fix sorted it, and a re-capture confirmed it.

